{"title": "Globe of Invulnerability (area)", "pageid": 39974, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability_(area)", "categories": ["Summoned areas", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability (area) controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Globe of Invulnerability</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a> created by <a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\">Globe of Invulnerability</a>. It creates a dome where any creature inside is temporarily invulnerable to all damage.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Invulnerable_.28Globe_of_Invulnerability.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)\"> Condition: Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/30px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/45px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/60px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/30px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" de